cff-version: 1.2.0
title: RoamRadar
message: "If you use RoamRadar, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
abstract: >-
  RoamRadar is a free, open-source, self-hosted personal travel app. It keeps
  every flight, hotel, ride, countdown, wishlist and past trip on one living
  timeline, and can pull bookings automatically from Google Calendar and Gmail.
  It runs as a single Cloudflare Worker on your own account. Built with AI agents.
authors:
